<pre><strong>Input:</strong> l1 =3D [2,4,3], l2 =3D [5,6,4]
<strong>Output:</strong> [7,0,8]
<strong>Explanation:</strong> 342 + 465 =3D 807.
</pre>

<p><strong class=3D"example">Example 2:</strong></p>

<pre><strong>Input:</strong> l1 =3D [0], l2 =3D [0]
<strong>Output:</strong> [0]
</pre>

<p><strong class=3D"example">Example 3:</strong></p>

<pre><strong>Input:</strong> l1 =3D [9,9,9,9,9,9,9], l2 =3D [9,9,9,9]
<strong>Output:</strong> [8,9,9,9,0,0,0,1]
</pre>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>

